- `scripts/perpetual-frontier-genesis-tick.mjs` v3 integration: successful GENESIS + ideation cycles receive a bounded 16-lens expansion envelope and explicit expansion counts.

This deliberately excludes historical #658 docs/artifacts because they overclaim Life Sensorium/Substrate Liberation as already-current. Those remain separate donor candidates.

