Turns the founder's self-folding Sandwich Method into an exact-current, evidence-bound self-completion protocol.

Core protocol:
CURRENT -> model stronger descendant -> compute negative image -> rank dependency-satisfied folds -> select highest-leverage authorized internal fold -> bounded mission -> independent verification -> existing promotion authority -> new exact current -> recompute stronger descendant -> repeat.

Added:
- exact-head bound target graph and finite negative-image computation
