Critical laws:
- hypothetical descendants expand search space but cannot authorize implementation;
- no VERIFIED_CURRENT node becomes authoritative without independently bound evidence of the correct reality class;
- no self-attested fold completion;
- code existence is not runtime proof, simulation is not physical/life proof;
- external/provider/commercial/physical/founder-choice/elapsed-reality gaps cannot be minted closed by source;
- blueprint evolution may discover new missing dimensions but cannot erase stubborn gaps without TARGET_INVALIDATED evidence plus independent verification;
- a larger negative image may be progress when a stronger system discovers previously invisible structure;
- same blocker + same strategy + no new evidence requires strategy mutation;
- founder-private target content may not be read from repo paths or emitted in full to ordinary stdout;
- existing execution-leaf continuation, verifier, promotion, signing, deployment and consequence gates retain authority.

