## Authority / truth boundary
The importer performs no network transport, signing, deployment, systemd action, payment, messaging, spend, DNS or credential mutation. It only validates owner/root-presented bytes and admits them into the protected local evidence ingress. This does **not** claim that a signer, courier, runtime rehearsal, customer, payment, Personal Civilization outcome, or ASI event has occurred on a real owner host.

